<title>FINLAND: Valmet to rebuild Stora machine.</title>
<headline>Valmet to rebuild Stora machine.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy said in a statement on Thursday it won a 200 million markka order to rebuild a newsprint machine at Swedish Stora AB's Hylte mill in Sweden.</p>
<p>&quot;The machine's production capacity will be increased by 15,000 tonnes to about 190,000 tonnes per year when it is started up after the rebuild in January 1998,&quot; Valmet said.  </p>
<p>The modernisation will also improve the uniformity and printing properties of the paper produced by the Hylte mill's paper machine number three, originally delivered by Valmet in 1979, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
